y, or candidate operating-map change makes prior hazard evidence stale for the affected scope.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nSHELTER and TRANSIT staging consume CLIMATE district triggers; COMMS may publish only the operating state authorized by COUNCIL.\nLINEAGE records map changes and REVIEW requires current candidate-bound threshold evidence.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| CLI-000 | north-district | v3 | 39.0 | degrees-C-WBGT | superseded |\n| CLI-001 | river-district | v3 | 40.7 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-002 | central-core | v3 | 39.5 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-003 | hillside | v3 | 41.2 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-004 | north-district | v3 | 40.0 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-005 | river-district | v3 | 41.7 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-006 | central-core | v3 | 40.5 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-007 | hillside | v3 | 39.3 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-008 | north-district | v3 | 41.0 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-009 | river-district | v3 | 39.8 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-010 | central-core | v3 | 41.5 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-011 | hillside | v3 | 40.3 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-012 | north-district | v3 | 39.1 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-013 | river-district | v4 | 40.8 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-014 | central-core | v4 | 39.6 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-015 | hillside | v4 | 41.3 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-016 | north-district | v4 | 40.1 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-017 | river-district | v4 | 41.8 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-018 | central-core | v4 | 40.6 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-019 | hillside | v4 | 39.4 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-020 | north-district | v4 | 41.1 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-021 | river-district | v4 | 39.9 | degrees-C-WBGT | current |\n| CLI-022 | central-core | v4 | 41.6 | degrees-C-W